{"url": "https://www.olt.com/main/home/canusepremium.php", "text": "\r\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n\t\r\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n\t<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Primary Meta Tags -->\r\n\t<title>Premium Tax Filing - OLT.com | Free Federal &amp; State Returns</title>\r\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Upgrade to OLT.com\\&#039;s Premium Edition for priority support, free tax filing, and discounted state returns. Enjoy live chat, phone assistance, and secure online access. Get your federal and state returns ready today!\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"tax filing, IRS e-file, free federal returns, state tax returns, Premium Edition, customer service, online tax filing, discounted state returns, priority support, secure online access\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Open Graph / Facebook -->\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Premium Tax Filing - OLT.com | Free Federal &amp; State Returns\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Upgrade to OLT.com\\&#039;s Premium Edition for priority support, free tax filing, and discounted state returns. Enjoy live chat, phone assistance, and secure online access. Get your federal and state returns ready today!\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.olt.com/main/home/canusepremium.php\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.olt.com/main/home/images/logo_og_image.png\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"OLT.com - Online Taxes\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Twitter -->\r\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Premium Tax Filing - OLT.com | Free Federal &amp; State Returns\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Upgrade to OLT.com\\&#039;s Premium Edition for priority support, free tax filing, and discounted state returns. Enjoy live chat, phone assistance, and secure online access. Get your federal and state returns ready today!\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.olt.com/main/home/images/logo_og_image.png\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Canonical URL -->\r\n\t<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.olt.com/main/home/canusepremium.php\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Other Meta -->\r\n\t<meta name=\"format-detection\" content=\"telephone=no\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- JSON-LD Structured Data -->\r\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is OLT.com really free to file federal taxes?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. OLT.com allows all U.S. taxpayers to file their federal income tax return for free - regardless of income level, filing status, or tax situation. There are no hidden fees and no income caps on the free federal filing option. State returns are available for $9.95 per state. For taxpayers who want additional support, the Premium Edition is available for $7.95 per return and includes phone support, live chat, audit assistance, and priority processing. OLT.com is an IRS-authorized e-file provider with a 100% accuracy guarantee.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What tax forms and schedules does OLT support?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"OLT supports all major IRS forms and schedules needed to file a complete federal tax return for tax year 2025. This includes Form 1040, Form 1040-SR for seniors, and Form 1040-NR for nonresident aliens. OLT also supports Schedule A (itemized deductions), Schedule B (interest and dividends), Schedule C (business income), Schedule D (capital gains), Schedule E (rental and royalty income), Schedule SE (self-employment tax), and the new Schedule 1-A for 2025 deductions on qualified tips, overtime pay, car loan interest, and the enhanced senior deduction. Additional forms include Schedule 8812 for the Child Tax Credit, Form 8962 for the Premium Tax Credit, Form 8863 for education credits, and Form 1099-series reporting for interest, dividends, and contractor income.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What changed in tax year 2025 that affects my return?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Tax year 2025 introduces several important changes that OLT automatically applies when you file. The new Schedule 1-A allows taxpayers to claim deductions for qualified tips (up to $25,000), qualified overtime compensation, car loan interest on passenger vehicles, and an enhanced deduction for seniors born before January 2, 1961 (up to $6,000 per person or $12,000 for married filing jointly). The Child Tax Credit has increased to $2,200 per qualifying child, with the Additional Child Tax Credit maximum set at $1,700. The SALT deduction cap has risen to $40,000. Digital asset sales are now reported by brokers using the new Form 1099-DA. The maximum income subject to Social Security tax is $176,100 for 2025. The filing deadline for most taxpayers is April 15, 2026.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who can file their taxes with OLT.com?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"OLT.com supports a wide range of tax situations for U.S. taxpayers, including: W-2 Employees - File your taxes easily and securely with OLT and get the maximum refund you deserve. Self-Employed & Freelancers - OLT handles Schedule C, self-employment tax (Schedule SE), and all 1099-NEC and 1099-K reporting with ease. Retirees - Report Social Security benefits, pensions, and IRA withdrawals. OLT calculates taxable portions automatically. Families - Claim the Child Tax Credit (up to $2,200 per child for 2025), Earned Income Credit, and dependent care credits. Investors - Report stock sales, cryptocurrency transactions, dividends, and capital gains on Schedule D. Rental Property Owners - Report rental income, claim depreciation, and track property expenses on Schedule E. Students - Claim education credits like the American Opportunity Credit and Lifetime Learning Credit. Small Business Owners - OLT includes Schedule C and all business forms to cover your self-employment income.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does filing with OLT.com work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Filing with OLT.com is a straightforward online process. First, create a free account at OLT.com. Then enter your personal information, import or manually enter your W-2s and 1099 forms, and follow the guided step-by-step interview that walks you through income, deductions, and credits. OLT calculates your estimated refund or amount owed in real time before you submit. When you are ready, OLT e-files your return directly with the IRS as an authorized e-file provider. Refunds are typically deposited into your bank account within 21 days of IRS acceptance. The Premium Edition adds phone and live chat support, audit assistance, year-over-year return comparison, and priority processing for $7.95 per return.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I find tax guides and educational resources?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"OLT provides a comprehensive Tax Knowledge Base at kb.olt.com with detailed articles, form-by-form guides, and educational content covering every aspect of federal and state tax filing. Topics include a complete Form 1040 filing guide, the new Schedule 1-A deductions for 2025, guides to the Child Tax Credit (Schedule 8812), reporting interest income (Form 1099-INT), understanding additional taxes (Schedule 2), and state-specific tax resources for all 50 states. You can also visit the OLT Tax Corner for seasonal tips, tax news, and deadline reminders. For personalized tax advice, consult a licensed tax professional.\"}}]}\r\n\t</script>\r\n\t\r\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"On-Line Taxes, Inc.\",\"alternateName\":\"OLT.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.olt.com/\",\"logo\":\"https://www.olt.com/main/home/images/logo.png\",\"foundingDate\":\"2000\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"St. Joseph\",\"addressRegion\":\"MO\",\"addressCountry\":\"US\"}}</script>\r\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"OLT.com Online Tax Filing\",\"applicationCategory\":\"FinanceApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"url\":\"https://www.olt.com/\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.8\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"ratingCount\":\"126000\"},\"offers\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Federal Free Edition\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"description\":\"Free federal tax return, all supported federal forms.\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"State Return\",\"price\":\"9.95\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"description\":\"Per state return with the Free Edition.\"},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Premium Edition\",\"price\":\"7.95\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"description\":\"Federal return with phone and live chat support, audit support, year-over-year comparison and priority processing. State returns $7.95.\"}]}</script>\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Favicon -->\r\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"images/olt.ico\">\r\n\t\r\n\t<!-- Stylesheets -->\r\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/bootstrap.min.css?v=1756173047\">\r\n\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/default_new.css?v=1790600190\">\r\n\t<script src=\"js/jquery-3.5.1.min.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n\r\n<body class=\"overflow-x-hidden\" >\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n#Privacy-Banner\r\n{\r\n\tposition: fixed !important;\r\n\tbottom: 0 !important;\r\n\tleft: 0 !important;\r\n\tright: 0 !important;\r\n\twidth: 100vw !important;\r\n\tmax-width: 100% !important;\r\n\tmargin: 0 !important;\r\n\tz-index: 1040;\r\n\tbackground: #062b5c !important;\r\n\tborder-top: 3px solid var(--color-brand-secondary, #762a78) !important;\r\n\tbox-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(6, 43, 92, 0.25) !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.modal\r\n{\r\n\tz-index: 1060 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.modal-backdrop\r\n{\r\n\tz-index: 1050 !important;\r\n\tbackground-color: rgba(6, 43, 92, 0.55) !important;\r\n\tbackdrop-filter: blur(4px);\r\n\t-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-item\r\n{\r\n\tbackground: #ffffff;\r\n\tborder: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, #e5eaf2);\r\n\tborder-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-secondary, #762a78) !important;\r\n\tborder-radius: 10px;\r\n\tpadding: 12px 18px;\r\n\ttransition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-item:hover\r\n{\r\n\ttransform: translateX(3px);\r\n\tborder-color: rgba(118, 42, 120, 0.35);\r\n\tbox-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(118, 42, 120, 0.08);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-key\r\n{\r\n\tdisplay: inline-block;\r\n\tbackground-color: var(--color-bg-warm, #faf5fb);\r\n\tborder: 1px solid var(--color-border-active, #eaddec);\r\n\tborder-radius: 6px;\r\n\tpadding: 2px 8px;\r\n\tcolor: var(--color-brand-primary, #062b5c);\r\n\tfont-weight: 700;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-pill\r\n{\r\n\tdisplay: inline-flex;\r\n\talign-items: center;\r\n\tgap: 4px;\r\n\tborder-radius: 6px;\r\n\tpadding: 2px 8px;\r\n\tfont-size: 0.75rem;\r\n\tfont-weight: 500;\r\n\tline-height: 1.4;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-pill-brand\r\n{\r\n\tbackground-color: var(--color-bg-warm, #faf5fb);\r\n\tborder: 1px solid var(--color-border-active, #eaddec);\r\n\tcolor: var(--color-brand-secondary, #762a78);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.olt-cookie-pill-neutral\r\n{\r\n\tbackground-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, #f8fbff);\r\n\tborder: 1px solid var(--color-border-contrast, #dce6f2);\r\n\tcolor: var(--color-brand-primary, #062b5c);\r\n}\r\n\r\nbody.modal-open\r\n{\r\n\toverflow: hidden !important;\r\n\tpadding-right: 0 !important;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 991.98px)\r\n{\r\n\t#settingsModal.modal\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tpadding-left: 0 !important;\r\n\t\tpadding-right: 0 !important;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t#settingsModal .modal-dialog\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tmargin: 1.25rem auto !important;\r\n\t\tmax-width: 92vw !important;\r\n\t\theight: auto !important;\r\n\t\tmin-height: calc(100% - 2.5rem);\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t#settingsModal .modal-content\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tmax-height: 82vh !important;\r\n\t\tborder-radius: 16px !important;\r\n\t\tbox-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(6, 43, 92, 0.22) !important;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t#settingsModal .modal-body\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tmax-height: calc(82vh - 110px) !important;\r\n\t\toverflow-y: auto !important;\r\n\t\t-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<aside id=\"Privacy-Banner\" class=\"position-fixed bottom-0 start-0 w-100 py-3 px-3 px-md-4 text-white\" aria-label=\"Cookie and Privacy Consent\">\r\n\t<div class=\"container\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"row align-items-center gy-2\">\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center justify-content-md-start gap-2 text-center text-md-start\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"d-none d-md-inline-block flex-shrink-0 text-white-50 olt-icon olt-info-circle-fill olt-icon-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fw-medium text-white olt-font-14 olt-lh-1-5\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tWe use cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website.\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md-auto d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center justify-content-md-end gap-2 flex-shrink-0\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" id=\"AcceptID\" class=\"btn btn-sm px-4 py-2 fw-bold text-nowrap olt-btn-success-default\" onClick=\"SetCookie(this.id)\" aria-label=\"Accept all cookies\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tGot It\r\n\t\t\t\t</button>\r\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" id=\"SettingsID\" class=\"btn btn-sm px-4 py-2 fw-semibold text-nowrap olt-btn-secondary-default\" data-bs-backdrop=\"static\" data-bs-toggle=\"modal\" data-bs-target=\"#settingsModal\" aria-label=\"View cookie settings and privacy details\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMore Info\r\n\t\t\t\t</button>\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n</aside>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"settingsModal\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"settingsModalLabel\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"dialog\">\r\n\t<div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg\">\r\n\t\t<section class=\"modal-content border-0 rounded-4 shadow-lg overflow-hidden\">\r\n\t\t\t<header class=\"modal-header border-0 px-3 py-2 text-white olt-bg-primary\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"opacity-75 text-white olt-icon olt-accuracy-tick olt-icon-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"modal-title fs-5 fw-bold text-white mb-0\" id=\"settingsModalLabel\">Privacy settings</h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close btn-close-white\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\r\n\t\t\t</header>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-body p-3 text-start olt-bg-canvas\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3 p-3 mb-3 rounded-3 border bg-white shadow-sm olt-border-subtle\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex-shrink-0 olt-icon olt-tick olt-icon-18 olt-text-secondary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mb-0 olt-text-muted olt-font-13 olt-lh-1-5\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCookies are required for basic website functions. This ensures that the website functions properly.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-column gap-2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<article class=\"bg-white shadow-sm olt-cookie-item\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"olt-cookie-key olt-font-13 olt-font-primary-mono\">_ga</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex align-items-cente